{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"They pause a moment, then pull him in to kiss him, \"Oh, you silly cat. I was only waiting for you. I'm glad you did, now I can tell people!\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:44:18.707000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225432641404938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I love you!\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:44:27.513000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225469576708237","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I love you as well, Arctura\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:44:45.722000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225545950527489","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I'm glad you had a good time. As long as you didn't sleep with anyone, okay?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:44:52.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225573805162577","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"No I would never do that to you. Is that what you thought? No wonder you seemed so anxious.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:45:24.929000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225710396866673","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I'm sorry. I trust you, I've just seen it happen far too often in the past.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:46:08.427000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738225892840570890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Past... Yours is gone now. That must be freeing to you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:46:40.981000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226029382074369","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"It is not gone. I am simply atoning for it. It's important to not forget our sins, only to forgive them – although it is freeing to have truly moved to kindness.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:48:10.463000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226404696522813","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Well said. Kindness, I have missed that, but you always give it to me.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:49:00.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226616542429274","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I try, my darling.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:49:20.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738226696880128020","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
